  "strings": [
    "Still, the battle hangs in precarious balance...\u0000",
    "until at last Aragorn appears with the Army of the Dead.\u0000",
    "Then, nothing that lives can survive their wrath.\u0000",
    "Great as our victory might seem, this war is not yet won.\u0000",
    "The Dark Lord still gathers strength behind the walls of Mordor.\u0000",
    "To draw the Eye of Sauron far from the Ringbearer...\u0000",
    "even greater sacrifices must now be endured.\u0000",
    "The Men of the West must confront him upon his borders\u0000",
    "and within his realm.\u0000",
    "And even dare to assault the Dark Lord himself.\u0000"
  ]
